# Models are hosted as GitHub Release assets — not stored in this repo.

# The Makefile drives the Jetson deployment and is executed on Linux. GNU
# make treats a trailing \r as part of the recipe, so a CRLF checkout breaks
# every target with errors that point nowhere near the cause. core.autocrlf
# is true on at least one machine working on this repo, so pin it explicitly
# rather than relying on each checkout's configuration.
Makefile text eol=lf
